<section class="contract-band major-divider" aria-label="Product contract">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="contract-grid">
      <article>
        <h2>What it does</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Compose and reuse presets and templates for agents and skills.</li>
          <li>Validate and build deterministic OpenCode-native agent and skill files with <code>atlante build</code>.</li>
          <li>Test your harness in OpenCode with versioned scenarios and <code>atlante eval</code>.</li>
          <li>Share your harness as a Pack, installable with <code>atlante init --pack &lt;your-pack&gt;</code>.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>What it does not</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Perform LLM inference or run agents and skills.</li>
          <li>Execute your project code.</li>
          <li>Choose models, effort, permissions, tools, or modes.</li>
          <li>Manage runtime state, checkpoints, or scheduling.</li>
          <li>Support hosts other than OpenCode in the current version.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

